{"id":"459534","name":"鸡蛋羹","author":"Miss_大米","authorId":"11075235","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/459534/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"食盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"1勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"两个鸡蛋打入碗中。","img":"images/459534/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加1.5倍凉开水。","img":"images/459534/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"将白色部分挑出，搅散。","img":"images/459534/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入少量食盐搅匀。","img":"images/459534/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"将气泡滤出，蒸出来的蛋羹更嫩滑。","img":"images/459534/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"盖上保鲜膜，扎几个小孔。","img":"images/459534/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"水开后上锅蒸十五分钟即可。","img":"images/459534/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放一勺生抽。","img":"images/459534/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"嫩滑的鸡蛋羹就做好了。","img":"images/459534/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}